%% helix-im 设计图 04 —— channel gate 三阶段状态机（peek/落库/commit + cursor 单调 + too_long）
%% 真源: src/channel.rs（Channel::{ingest,on_persist_ok,peek_up_to,commit_cursor,reset_for_too_long,buffer_and_arm_gate}）
%% 关联: HX-C005（event_to_upsert_op 单 INSERT O(1) ON CONFLICT temporary_id，无 read-modify-write）
%%        HX-C008（cursor 单调不回退 · gate 缺口续拉 · too_long 清内存不清表）
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Synced: Channel::new(initial_cursor)

    note left of Synced
      不变量（channel.rs）✅
      1. cursor 单调不减（MAX guard try_advance）
      2. cursor 只在写成功后推（WS PersistFire 幂等 / sync PortReply Ok）
      3. seq <= cursor 一律 dup drop（幂等去重）
      4. WS=flush_contiguous（严格+1，遇空洞停）
         sync=peek/commit（跳空洞到权威 next_seq）
    end note

    Synced --> Synced: ingest seq == cursor+1\napply_and_flush_contiguous ✅\nPersistFire upsert(O(1)) + try_advance\n+ emit im:post:received + flush 连续段
    Synced --> Synced: ingest seq <= cursor\ndup drop（幂等，零副作用）

    Synced --> Gapped: ingest seq > cursor+1\nbuffer.insert + arm 1s gate timer\n（gate=Some, expected=cursor+1）⚠️缺口
    Gapped --> Gapped: 再来乱序事件\n只入 buffer，不重复 arm（gate.is_some）
    Gapped --> Gapped: 收到 cursor+1 的事件\nflush_contiguous_from_buffer\n连续段一次性放行 + cursor 推进
    Gapped --> Synced: buffer 连续段补齐到无缺口

    Gapped --> SyncPull: gate 1s timer fire（handle_timer）\nEffect::Http sync/notify(fromSeq=cursor)\ngate=None + inflight_sync 守卫（B1）

    state "sync 权威三阶段（peek→落库→commit）" as SyncPull {
        [*] --> Peek
        Peek: ① peek_up_to(target)（只读预览 ops，不推 cursor）
        Peek --> Persisting: ② out.push Persist{corr, ops}（driver 落库）\npending_commits[corr]=commit_target
        Persisting --> Committed: ③ PortReply Ok → on_persist_ok\ncommit_cursor(MAX guard) + buffer.retain(>target)\n+ flush_contiguous_from_buffer
        Persisting --> PersistFail: ③' PortReply Err ⚠️\ncursor 不推进 + last_sync_from_seq=None（待 re-sync 恢复）
        Committed --> [*]
        PersistFail --> [*]
    }
    SyncPull --> Synced: commit 完成 cursor 推到权威水位

    Gapped --> TooLong: buffer.len ≥ 16384（MAX_GATE_BUFFER）\n或 sync 返回 TooLong{reset_to}
    Synced --> TooLong: sync 返回 TooLong{reset_to}
    state "too_long 兜底" as TooLong {
        note right of TooLong
          清内存 buffer + gate=None ⚠️
          cursor 复位 reset_to-1（不回退已落地数据）
          emit im:sync:too_long（前端清表全量重拉）
          SQLite 数据不清——靠 upsert 覆盖（HX-C008）
        end note
    }
    TooLong --> SyncPull: 从 cursor+1 重拉缺口
